# Trivy ignore list. Every entry needs a justification and, where applicable,
# a tracking reference for removing it.

# react-router "RSC Mode CSRF Bypass Allows Action Execution Before 400
# Response" (HIGH, >= 7.12.0 < 8.3.0, only fixed in the v8 major). Not
# exploitable here: the UI is a client-only SPA using declarative
# <BrowserRouter> (ui/src/main.tsx) — no RSC mode, no framework-mode server
# actions, no react-router server runtime. Remove when the UI moves to
# react-router 8.
